title Grid Balancing Recommendation Business Process

Camunda->Kong: Trigger Grid Balancing Analysis
Kong->Grid Service: Forward Request
activate Grid Service

Grid Service->Telemetry Service: Get Zone Telemetry Data
activate Telemetry Service
Telemetry Service->Database: Query telemetry grouped by zone
Database-->Telemetry Service: Zone data (SoC, capacity per zone)
Telemetry Service-->Grid Service: Response
deactivate Telemetry Service

Grid Service->AssetLink Service: Get Active Links
activate AssetLink Service
AssetLink Service-->Grid Service: Active links list
deactivate AssetLink Service

note right of Grid Service: Detect deficit/surplus zones\nIf zone load > 80% maxCapacity:\nfind neighbouring zone with surplus

Grid Service->Database: INSERT INTO GridBalancingRecommendations\n(deficitZoneId, surplusZoneId, recommendedActionKw, timestamp)
Database-->Grid Service: OK

Grid Service->Kafka: Publish Recommendation
note right of Kafka: Topic = grid-balancing-recommendation

Grid Service-->Kong: Response
deactivate Grid Service
Kong-->Camunda: Forward Response
